@DocMind.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5276

### Create an account. Identity's default policy needs 6+ characters with upper and lower
### case letters, a digit and a symbol.
POST {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

###

### Log in. ?useCookies=true makes the API set a session cookie, which the REST Client
### extension keeps and sends with the requests below; without it /login returns a bearer
### token instead.
POST {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login?useCookies=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

###

### Show the signed-in user.
GET {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/manage/info

###

### Log out (expires the session cookie).
POST {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/logout

###

### Upload and index a PDF document.
# Replace the path below with a real .pdf file on your machine before running this request.
POST {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----DocMindBoundary

------DocMindBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\path\to\your\document.pdf
------DocMindBoundary--

###

### Start a conversation with its first question.
POST {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "example question",
  "topK": 5
}

###

### List the signed-in user's conversations, most recently used first.
GET {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/conversations

###

### Ask a follow-up, read and delete one conversation. Paste a conversationId from above.
@conversationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

POST {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "another question"
}

###

GET {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}

###

DELETE {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}

###

### List the signed-in user's documents, newest first.
GET {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/documents

###

### Download and delete one document. Paste a documentId from the list above.
@documentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

GET {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/documents/{{documentId}}/file

###

DELETE {{DocMind.Api_HostAddress}}/documents/{{documentId}}

###
